### Prompt 13: Deploy

Step-by-step **Vercel**: private GitHub repo, import, env from `.env.example`, custom domain with www → apex, Resend DNS. `next.config` **301 redirects** from old URLs (`[PASTE OLD URLS]`). Post-launch: Search Console + Bing sitemap, forms E2E, Follow Up Boss, GA4/Meta events.

### Prompt 14: Final QA

Senior SEO + CRO audit vs these rules: CTAs, forms + fallbacks, schema (Rich Results Test), unique titles/descriptions, internal links, consolidated **TODO** report, 375px mobile, brokerage disclosures every page. Prioritized fix list; fix what you can in code.